title: "transfer and public_transfer (Sui Framework: transfer)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_ability: T must have key ability
    q_check_ability --> q_transfer_impl: transfer_impl(obj, recipient)
    q_transfer_impl --> [*]: object ownership changed to recipient

    note right of q_check_ability
        INV-001: transfer() restricted to module defining T (bytecode verifier)
        INV-002: public_transfer() requires T to have key + store
        INV-003: if recipient is an object ID, obj becomes inaccessible until receive
        INV-004: native implementation handles ownership change
    end note
